Hi again,

I take that patch back - it won't help you.  Instead I went to the
source and fixed affxparser.  I've committed a bug fix to BioConductor
- both to the release (now v1.14.1) and the developers versions
(v1.15.1).  You'll have to wait for the next BioC build cycle which
